flowchart LR
    accTitle: Internal simulation and candidate improvement
    accDescr: An initial candidate is considered through internal simulation. A possible defect is identified and a modified candidate is proposed back into planning. The entire pattern remains internal; no external action or environmental observation occurs in this diagram.

    CAND[Initial candidate]
    SIM[Internal reasoning<br/>simulate possible consequences]
    DEFECT[Possible defect identified]
    MODIFY[Propose a modification]
    REVISED[Revised candidate]
    RETURN[Return to planning<br/>for further consideration]
    CAND --> SIM --> DEFECT --> MODIFY --> REVISED --> RETURN

    classDef process fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef candidate fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.1px;
    classDef result fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.4px;
    class SIM,MODIFY process;
    class CAND,DEFECT candidate;
    class REVISED,RETURN result;
